data: {"id": "82749cf92cb04c12-thinking-parallel_evidence-1287", "run_id": "82749cf92cb04c12", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实与因果分析\n\n**1. 实体身份确认**\n- Pod: `aiops-case-v08/workload`\n- UID: `00e5e755-886e-4661-9e8a-00d1e71595f6`\n- 当前状态: `Running` (Phase), `CrashLoopBackOff` (Container Waiting Reason), `Exit Code: 127`\n\n**2. 支持“容器主进程启动失败”的证据（高度一致）**\n- **Exit Code 127**: `kubectl_describe` 和 YAML 均确认容器终止原因为 `Exit Code: 127`，在 Unix/Linux 中，127 代表 \"command not found\"（命令/文件未找到）。\n- **主进程 Command 配置**: Pod YAML 显示主进程配置为 `sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command`。\n- **崩溃前日志**: Elasticsearch 返回的 6 条记录全部为 `sh: exec: line 0:", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789134751245, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

