data: {"id": "82749cf92cb04c12-final", "run_id": "82749cf92cb04c12", "seq": 1292, "ts_ms": 1789134770171, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v08/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v08/workload 持续处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning BackOff 4m27s (x210 over 49m) kubelet Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v08(00e5e755-886e-4661-9e8a-00d1e71595f6)` | 确认 Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态及长时间退避重启的周期 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | 主进程退出码：`127`；最后一次退出原因：`Error`；重启次数：`14` | 退出码 127 明确指向操作系统层面的“命令/文件未找到”错误 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | 2026-09-11T13:34:23.904Z 日志：`sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found` | 直接证明容器试图执行的入口命令 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 在镜像中不存在 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | 2026-09-11T13:52:14.920Z 样本：`kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` (reason=Error) = 1, `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=CrashLoopBackOff) = 1 | 独立于 K8s API 验证了容器因 Error 终止并处于等待重启状态 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器资源限制：Memory `32Mi` / CPU `50m`，请求：Memory `8Mi` / CPU `50m` | 排除因资源超限（OOM）或 CPU 不足导致终止的可能性 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n日志中的“Command not found”（第 3 条）与 K8s 状态报告的“Exit Code 127”（第 2 条）在机制上完全一致，127 正是 Shell 执行缺失命令时的标准返回码。指标数据（第 4 条）作为第三视角再次确认了终止状态，且资源配置（第 5 条）的极低配额与 CrashLoopBackOff 的症状无矛盾，但不足以支撑 OOMKill 的证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器镜像中缺少主进程可执行文件 /opt/app/unavailable-command → 容器启动时 shell 执行命令失败并返回 Exit Code 127 → Kubernetes 持续探测到容器异常退出并触发指数退避重启 → Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**容器入口点命令 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 在容器镜像中不存在**。\n该事实由 `logging` 维度直接捕获的“not found”报错以及 `kubernetes` 维度反映的“Exit Code 127”共同确证。Kubernetes API 观察到的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 以及 Prometheus 指标中的 `Error` 终止状态均为该根因导致的直接症状。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 38.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v08/workload: 38.6s (Evidence 30.5s, RCA 8.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v08/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 70.85, "metrics": {"run_id": "82749cf92cb04c12", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 70.85672736167908, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 70856.72736167908, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 68197.05581665039, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 603